WEBVTT

00:14:29.134 --> 00:14:31.091
it's not like that at all.

00:14:31.115 --> 00:14:33.450
It's like the internet itself.

00:14:33.474 --> 00:14:36.887
It's an interconnected network
of serving knowledge,

00:14:36.911 --> 00:14:38.069
sharing knowledge,

00:14:38.093 --> 00:14:40.005
and using each other's knowledge.

00:14:40.029 --> 00:14:42.323
That is, multidisciplinary knowledge,

00:14:42.347 --> 00:14:44.085
different kinds of science knowledge

00:14:44.109 --> 00:14:47.529
to be able to see and understand

00:14:47.553 --> 00:14:48.958
before action.

00:14:49.402 --> 00:14:51.125
All we're doing is building tools

00:14:51.149 --> 00:14:56.227
that interconnect different
organizations' information.

00:14:56.665 --> 00:15:00.498
And independent actors
running in independent organizations